                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A12/69: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Robbins</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-10-24T11:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 24,
                                1925—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 1:35
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>160. Your 385, Oct. 22, 4 p.m. to Paris. No comment whatever in local press.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robbins</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
